# Minimal Hyprland desktop: the compositor, a terminal and the desktop
# plumbing only. No bar, launcher or file manager is imposed - users bring
# their own dotfiles. legit-hyprland-config (AUR build) provides the
# wallpaper-only configuration that keeps Hyprland from showing its
# "using default config" banner.
hyprland
kitty
swaybg
xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland
xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
qt5-wayland
qt6-wayland
polkit-kde-agent
grim
slurp
wl-clipboard
sddm
pipewire
pipewire-audio
pipewire-pulse
wireplumber
rtkit
